op of a 110 m rock at the head of the point."],"poi":"pointsur"},{"t0":93.11,"dur":59.04,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":152.15,"dur":13.0,"zh":["右下方是麥克威瀑布，高 24 公尺。","漲潮時，瀑布直接落入海中。"],"en":["Below on the right: McWay Falls, 24 m high.","At high tide it falls straight into the ocean."],"poi":"mcway"},{"t0":165.15,"dur":112.35,"zh":[],"en":[]},{"t0":277.5,"dur":13.0,"zh":["1965 年，這段海岸公路成為加州第一條州級景觀公路。","1996 年，它又成為首批「全美公路」之一。"],"en":["In 1965 this coast road became California's first State Scenic Highway.","In 1996 it was among the first All-American Roads."]},{"t0":290.5,"dur":9.5,"zh":[],"en":[]}],"log":[{"t":0.0,"tt":0,"kind":"dep","zh":"出發：卡梅爾（卡梅爾河橋）","en":"Departure: Carmel (Carmel River bridge)"},{"t":61.62,"tt":1722,"kind":"poi","zh":"途經：比克斯比橋","en":"Bixby Bridge (passing)","k":"bixby"},{"t":85.96,"tt":2355,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 1 公里：蘇爾角燈塔","en":"Point Sur Light Station, 1 km right","k":"pointsur"},{"t":158.0,"tt":4709,"kind":"poi","zh":"右側 193 公尺：麥克威瀑布","en":"McWay Falls, 193 m right","k":"mcway"},{"t":300.0,"tt":9000,"kind":"arr","zh":"抵達：大蘇爾海岸南端","en":"Arrival: South end of the Big Sur coast"}],"note":{"zh":"模擬畫面：路線取自 OpenStreetMap，速度與時間為示意，並非實際班次紀錄；地形與衛星影像為真實資料。","en":"Simulation: the path comes from OpenStreetMap; speeds and times are illustrative, not a real timetable. Terrain and satellite imagery are real data."},"geo_src":"OSM relation 15632813 (Route 1 - Big Sur Coast Highway), Carmel→San Simeon","sources":[{"title":"OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL), route geometry","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Big Sur Coast Highway","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/articles/California_State_Route_1_(Big_Sur)"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): Bixby Bridge","url":"https://wikiwand.com/en/Bixby_Bridge"},{"title":"Wikipedia (en): Point Sur Light","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point_Sur_Light"},{"title":"Wikiwand / Wikipedia (en): McWay Falls","url":"https://www.wikiwand.com/en/articles/McWay_Falls"}]}